{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50709","headline":"投滑州上卢尚书 · 张祜","name":"投滑州上卢尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨露恩重棣萼繁，一时旌旆刊雄藩。\n权经两使材尤重，位近三台道益尊。\n江海豁开爲气岸，河隍坚画在心源。\n门阑尽是云霄客，应念於陵独灌园。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}